\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces The gate-aware contouring weight along the track, computed from \eqref  {eq:weight} for the competition layout. The weight sits at a low base on the straights and rises to a peak at each gate (G1 to G4), so tracking is stiff only where a gate must be threaded. Gates whose arc positions fall within the window merge into a single wider peak.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:weight}{{5}{4}{}{figure.5}{}}
